@startuml
scale 1.6
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F9F5
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FEE2E2
skinparam participantBorderColor #EF4444
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam noteBorderColor #CA8A04

title WebSocket 实时事件流 — Pipeline & Agent 全生命周期\n(前端 ↔ WebSocket ↔ PipelineEmitter ↔ AgentExecutor)

actor "用户" as User
participant "React Frontend\n(useWebSocket)" as Frontend
participant "WebSocket\nHandler" as WS
participant "Pipeline\nEmitter" as Emitter
participant "Harness\nOrchestrator" as Harness
participant "Agent\nExecutor" as Agent

== 连接建立 ==

Frontend -> WS: new WebSocket("ws://localhost:3000/ws")
WS --> Frontend: connected
Frontend -> Frontend: 初始化事件监听器\n(useRetrievalStore / useStatsStore)

== 场景A: 文档上传 → Pipeline处理 ==

User -> Frontend: 拖拽上传 PDF 文件
Frontend -> WS: 上传完成，开始监听

Frontend -> Harness: POST /api/documents/upload

Harness -> Emitter: 开始 INGEST Stage
Emitter -> WS: **stage:start**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:start",\n "stage":"ingest", "documentId":"doc-001",\n "timestamp": 1715000000}

Frontend -> Frontend: 更新 UI:\n📥 Ingest Stage → 进行中 (spinner)

Harness -> Harness: INGEST 完成
Harness -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **stage:progress**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:progress",\n "stage":"ingest", "progress":100,\n "status":"completed"}

Emitter -> WS: **stage:complete**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:complete",\n "stage":"ingest"}

Harness -> Harness: PARSE 完成
Emitter -> WS: **stage:start** (parse)
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:start",\n "stage":"parse"}

Emitter -> WS: **stage:complete** (parse)
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:complete",\n "stage":"parse"}

Harness -> Harness: CHUNK 进行中
Emitter -> WS: **stage:start** (chunk)
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:start",\n "stage":"chunk"}

Emitter -> WS: **chunk:created**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"chunk:created",\n "chunkId":"parent-A",\n "childCount":4,\n "tokenCount":1200,\n "qualityScore":0.85}

Emitter -> WS: **chunk:created**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"chunk:created",\n "chunkId":"parent-B",\n "childCount":5,\n "tokenCount":1600,\n "qualityScore":0.92}

Frontend -> Frontend: ChunkExplorer 实时更新:\nParent-A (1200 tokens, 4 children) 🟢\nParent-B (1600 tokens, 5 children) 🟢

Emitter -> WS: **stage:complete** (chunk)
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stage:complete",\n "stage":"chunk"}

Harness -> Harness: EMBED 完成
Emitter -> WS: **stage:start** (embed)
Emitter -> WS: **stage:complete** (embed)
Emitter -> WS: **pipeline:complete**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"pipeline:complete",\n "documentId":"doc-001",\n "totalDuration":3200,\n "totalChunks":9}

Frontend -> Frontend: PipelineTimeline 显示:\nINGEST ████ 0.3s\nPARSE  ████████ 1.2s\nCHUNK  ██████ 1.1s\nEMBED  ████ 0.6s

== 场景B: Medical Agent 查询 ==

User -> Frontend: 输入查询: "二甲双胍eGFR=35能否使用"

Frontend -> WS: 发起查询请求 (enableAgent: true)

Frontend -> Agent: POST /api/chat/generate

Agent -> Agent: 开始执行

Agent -> Emitter: Phase 1: 输入解析
Emitter -> WS: **agent:input**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:input",\n "agentPhase":"input",\n "query":"二甲双胍eGFR=35能否使用",\n "timestamp":1715001000}

Frontend -> Frontend: 显示: 🔍 分析查询...

Agent -> Agent: 实体识别完成

Agent -> Emitter: Phase 2: 实体识别
Emitter -> WS: **agent:entities**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:entities",\n "agentPhase":"entities",\n "entityMatches":[{\n   "matchedTerm":"二甲双胍",\n   "canonicalName":"二甲双胍",\n   "entityType":"drug",\n   "confidence":0.9\n },{\n   "matchedTerm":"eGFR",\n   "entityType":"indicator",\n   "extractedValue":35\n }]}

Frontend -> Frontend: 高亮显示实体:\n• 🏥 药物: 二甲双胍\n• 📊 指标: eGFR = 35

Agent -> Agent: 复杂度评估完成

Agent -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **agent:complexity**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:complexity",\n "agentPhase":"complexity",\n "complexity":{\n   "level":"moderate",\n   "needsPlanning":false,\n   "entityCount":2,\n   "reason":"单药物+指标值查询"\n }}

Agent -> Agent: 模式选择完成

Agent -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **agent:mode**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:mode",\n "agentPhase":"mode",\n "executionMode":"react",\n "executionReason":"简单查询,使用ReAct循环"}

Frontend -> Frontend: 显示执行模式: 🧠 ReAct 模式

Agent -> Agent: 查询优化完成

Agent -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **agent:query_rewrite**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:query_rewrite",\n "agentPhase":"query_rewrite",\n "queryRewriting":{\n   "primaryQuery":"二甲双胍 eGFR 肾功能禁忌症",\n   "expandedTerms":["格华止","肾功能不全"]\n }}

Frontend -> Frontend: 优化查询显示:\n"二甲双胍 eGFR 肾功能禁忌症"\n扩展: 格华止, 肾功能不全

Agent -> Agent: ReAct 循环执行中

Agent -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **agent:execution**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:execution",\n "agentPhase":"execution",\n "executorState":{\n   "iteration":1,\n   "satisfied":false,\n   "retrievalCount":0\n }}

Emitter -> WS: **agent:execution**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:execution",\n "agentPhase":"execution",\n "executorState":{\n   "iteration":2,\n   "satisfied":true,\n   "retrievalCount":5\n }}

Frontend -> Frontend: 实时更新:\n🔄 Iteration 1: 检索中...\n✅ Iteration 2: 满足条件

Agent -> Agent: Agent 执行完成

Agent -> Emitter:
Emitter -> WS: **agent:complete**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"agent:complete",\n "agentPhase":"complete",\n "agentResult":{\n   "satisfied":true,\n   "retrievalCount":5,\n   "totalTimeMs":1500,\n   "iterations":2,\n   "llmCallCount":1\n }}

Frontend -> Frontend: Agent 面板显示统计:\n📊 检索结果: 5条\n⏱️ 耗时: 1.5s\n🔄 迭代: 2次\n🧠 LLM调用: 1次

== 场景C: LLM 生成 (流式) ==

Agent -> Emitter: 开始生成答案

Emitter -> WS: **generation:start**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"generation:start"}

Emitter -> WS: **generation:thinking**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"generation:thinking",\n "content":"用户询问二甲双胍在eGFR=35时..."}

Frontend -> Frontend: 显示思考过程 (折叠):\n💭 "用户询问二甲双胍在eGFR=35时..."

Emitter -> WS: **generation:answer**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"generation:answer",\n "content":"## 结论\\n慎用..."}

Emitter -> WS: **generation:answer**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"generation:answer",\n "content":"eGFR 30-45ml/min时\n需减量至500-850mg/日"}

Frontend -> Frontend: 流式渲染答案
(逐字输出)

Emitter -> WS: **generation:complete**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"generation:complete"}

== 场景D: 统计数据更新 ==

Agent -> Emitter: 检索完成，更新统计

Emitter -> WS: **stats:update**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"stats:update",\n "totalDocuments":12,\n "totalChunks":248,\n "avgRetrievalTime":1200,\n "cacheHitRate":0.45}

Frontend -> Frontend: StatsDashboard 更新:\n📄 文档: 12\n📦 Chunks: 248\n⚡ 平均检索: 1.2s\n💾 缓存命中: 45%

Emitter -> WS: **metrics:update**
WS --> Frontend: {"type":"metrics:update",\n "evaluationMetrics":{\n   "avgFaithfulness":0.88,\n   "avgMedicalAccuracy":0.85,\n   "avgSafetyScore":0.92\n }}

Frontend -> Frontend: 评估面板更新:\n✅ Faithfulness: 88%\n✅ Medical Accuracy: 85%\n✅ Safety: 92%

== 事件类型总览 ==

note over Frontend, Agent
  **WebSocket 事件分类 (共 5 大类)**:

  **Pipeline 事件**: stage:start → stage:progress → stage:complete → chunk:created → pipeline:complete

  **Agent 事件**: agent:input → agent:entities → agent:complexity → agent:mode → agent:query_rewrite → agent:template → agent:dag → agent:execution → agent:complete

  **Generation 事件**: generation:start → generation:thinking → generation:answer → generation:complete

  **Stats 事件**: stats:update → metrics:update

  **Error 事件**: error
end note

@enduml
